# arms/adult/pose/man_l: the man's left arm in the postures (POSES-B, P2b wave 2): sleeve, bracer, hand (regions and the
# keys as man_r's header). Front: the screen's right, the shade side; back: the screen's left, the lit side; facing left
# the near arm, facing right the far one (behind the body). `gripL` marks where a prop held in the left hand goes.
# Blocked in from man_r's views mirrored and relit for this side, then checked by hand.
use person
body man
role arms std
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys armL
side L

